<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF to seek 80,000T of oilseeds Tuesday.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF to seek 80,000T of oilseeds Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) has invited tenders to buy a total of 80,000 tonnes of oilseeds by 11.00 a.m. (0200 GMT) next Tuesday, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The total breaks down into 30,000 tonnes of tapioca hard pellet, 42,000 tonnes of rapeseed meal and 8,000 tonnes of grain screening pellet, they said.  </p>
<p>Details for the tenders are as follows:</p>
<p>    COMMODS		  TONNE   ETA     ARRIVAL PORT</p>
<p>    rapeseed meal	  7,000   Jul 20  Inchon</p>
<p>    rapeseed meal	  7,000   Jul 30  Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p>    rapeseed meal	  7,000   Aug 20  Inchon</p>
<p>    rapeseed meal	  7,000   Aug 30  Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p>    rapeseed meal	  7,000   Sep 20  Inchon</p>
<p>    rapeseed meal	  7,000   Sep 30  Kunsan/Ulsan</p>
<p>    tapioca		 10,000   Jun 30  Inchon/Kunsan</p>
<p>    tapioca		 10,000   Aug 10  Inchon/Kunsan</p>
<p>    tapioca		 10,000   Sep 10  Inchon/Kunsan</p>
<p>    GSP			4,000   Jul 20  Inchon/Ulsan</p>
<p>    GSP			4,000   Sep 20  Inchon/Ulsan</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
